          "severity": "P2",
          "title": "Pagination loop lacks a max-iteration/cursor-safety guard",
          "text": "🟡 **P2**\n\n**Pagination loop lacks a max-iteration/cursor-safety guard**\n\nThe while loops in getMyListings and getOrders follow `next` indefinitely based on the API response. If the eBay API ever returns a `next` URL that repeats (e.g., due to a bug or unexpected pagination behavior), this could cause an infinite loop with unbounded memory growth in allOffers/allOrders. Consider adding a max page count or a check that nextUrl actually changes between iterations."
        },
